1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:39,000
On orders from the Wizard King, Asta and his fellow black bulls headed for the seaside village of Rockway and the underwater temple that lay off its coast.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Their mission? To enter the well-guarded temple, secure its magic stone, and prevent the Eye of the Midnight Sun from fulfilling their ambition to topple the Clover Kingdom and establish a sovereign state.

6
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,000
However...

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
What are you messing around for?

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
But you're not.

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Oh, hi, Captain Yomi.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Okay, you incompetent knuckleheads, listen up.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Apparently the underwater temple is beneath the surface of the ocean around here.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Unfortunately, the mana-driven currents are too strong, so even a skilled mage can't normally get near it.

13
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The only time the mana is weak enough to even possibly access it is during a full moon.

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,000
If you didn't guess already, the underwater temple is on the ocean floor. You need magic to get there.

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,000
So, Noelle, that's where your water magic comes in. We're gonna hitch a ride on it.

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,000
But, sir, I'd need exceptional control over my magic to manage something like that. No, I can't do it!

17
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:57,000
You have to, Noelle. The full moon's a week away. You've got till then to learn to control your magic. Push past your limits.

