102
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:55,360
All right, I guess I should introduce myself.

103
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,920
I'm Kahono, and you?

104
00:06:57,500 --> 00:07:00,660
My name's Noel, and this guy is Dorksta the Musclehead.

105
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,840
That's not my name, and I'm not a musclehead!

106
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:06,540
Huh, Noel and Dorksta the Musclehead.

107
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,340
You have such strange names.

108
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,780
Wait, you believe her?

109
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:10,740
Aw, come on!

110
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:11,320
Huh?

111
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,360
She's obviously making fun of me.

112
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,000
My real name's actually Asta.

113
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:17,440
Okay, it's nice to meet you, Asta.

114
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:20,440
So, Kahono, what are you doing out here so late?

115
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:21,560
Just singing.

116
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,300
Yeah, I gathered that much.

117
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:25,260
This is the perfect place for voice training.

118
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:28,420
The atmosphere, the acoustics, I just love singing here!

119
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,980
Voice training?

120
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,080
That's right!

121
00:07:31,340 --> 00:07:32,780
You see, I have this dream.

122
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:35,440
Between my singing, dancing, and spellcasting...

123
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:39,040
I'm gonna become an idol!

124
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,680
Uh, what's an idol?

125
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:41,540
What?

126
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,860
You're joking, right?

127
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:44,980
No, sorry.

128
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,420
But they're all the rage in the common and noble realms.

129
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,840
Come on, you know idols!

130
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:51,500
Uh...

131
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:57,060
Okay, so idols are people who are so good at singing, dancing, and using magic that everyone everywhere knows who they are.

132
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,620
Well, except you, I guess.

133
00:07:59,020 --> 00:07:59,380
Huh?

134
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:04,340
I'm gonna work and work and work and work until I make it as big as an idol and get crazy rich!

135
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:06,400
That's the reason you're doing it?

136
00:08:06,660 --> 00:08:08,520
I don't see what's so great about money.

137
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,320
I mean, it just gets in the way.

138
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:11,840
You're wrong there.

139
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:16,260
You royals are basically rolling in the stuff, so you probably can't understand this.

140
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:17,100
But money?

141
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,340
It's a big deal.

142
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:21,020
I mean, without it, you can't buy pot potatoes.

143
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:24,360
If you don't have any pot potatoes, just eat steak instead.

144
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,320
Royalty!

145
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,580
There, you see?

146
00:08:28,700 --> 00:08:30,120
Money is totally important.

147
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:32,580
Wow, dorksta, I feel like you really get me.

148
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,460
Please don't use that dumb nickname.

149
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,620
Sorry, dorksta.

150
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:37,120
Seriously, it's hasta.

151
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:38,640
Okay, right.

152
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,660
Sorry, I...

153
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,120
Hold on.

154
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,840
What's wrong?

155
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:43,580
Hmm?

156
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,620
