I'm a commoner, though.

226
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:11,120
Okay, so what brings you here?

227
00:11:11,660 --> 00:11:12,100
Vacation?

228
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:16,220
Nah, actually, we've got an important mission at the Underwater Temple.

229
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,140
Shut up, Asta!

230
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,580
