Please don't listen to him.

232
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,180
It's top secret, so...

233
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:22,680
Okay, whatever.

234
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,240
So you two were out here pretty late.

235
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:26,560
Were you...

236
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,620
Well, you know...

237
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:31,080
What are you talking about?

238
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:32,380
As if we would ever!

239
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:35,140
The moonlight is so terribly romantic, though.

240
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:38,000
And the sound of the waves is perfect mood music.

241
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:42,660
Oh, I'm telling you, whatever you may have been thinking, it isn't like that at all, okay?

242
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:43,800
I'm out here training!

243
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:45,280
Like with magic?

244
00:11:45,460 --> 00:11:46,860
Yes, with magic.

245
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,580
And I have a lot of work to do.

246
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:53,740
I can't go into detail, but I need to find a way to control my magic in a week before the full moon.

247
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:57,820
If I don't, then our mission will fail.

248
00:11:57,820 --> 00:11:58,780
Right, I get the gist.

249
00:11:59,160 --> 00:11:59,800
Let's see.

250
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,240
A control issue.

251
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:02,540
Very interesting.

252
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,460
Well, go on, Noelle.

253
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,740
Show me what you can do.

254
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:06,300
Huh?

255
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:17,460
Come on, Noelle!

256
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,600
You can do it!

257
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:20,700
Wow, she's really powerful!

258
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:30,980
Yes, I see. Nice job, Noelle!

259
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,660
Now, as your new friend, I have a little piece of advice for you.

260
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:39,780
I think you might be having trouble with control because you're trying too hard to hold back your mana.

261
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,180
Stand still and listen a sec.

262
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,060
Hear them?

263
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:50,660
I relax by listening to the sound of the waves,

264
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:55,640
and then try to cast my spells without letting myself get too caught up in my own thoughts and feelings.

265
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:57,040
Just like that?

266
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:59,740
I'm not a philosopher or anything,

267
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:04,480
but I've always thought that the best way to focus was to have a serene mind and a peaceful heart.

268
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,640
A serene mind?

269
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:07,460
I'm not sure I understand.

270
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,340
I do?

271
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:13,580
I always feel like I do my best fighting when my mind's clear and I'm not thinking about anything!

272
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:15,200
Oh, yeah, what would you know about it?

273
00:13:15,300 --> 00:13:18,100
You don't even use magic and you're always not thinking.

274
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,120
Try to focus on your fondest memory.

275
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:21,620
Something comforting, you know?

276
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:23,560
Um, okay.

277
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,820
I'll try.

278
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:26,460
It's not that hard.

279
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:27,640
What about your family?

280
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:29,640
My family, huh?

281
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:41,860
The last thing the Steel Warrior Princess left behind was a useless little girl.

282
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:45,220
As if this tragedy were great enough already.

283
00:13:46,860 --> 00:13:51,460
I don't see how anyone could ever accept a failure like you as their sister.

284
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,300
I swear, I'm trying, brother.

285
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:56,960
How is it possible you were born to the same mother as us?

286
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,300
Pathetic wretch.

287
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:00,260
You don't belong in our house.

288
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,620
Please, Nebra.

289
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:03,580
I do.

290
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,820
Nozel, will you just talk to me?

291
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:10,640
Why wasn't it you who died instead of our mother?

292
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:14,140
You're a mistake and an embarrassment to the Great Silva name.

293
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:23,580
You killed our mother.

294
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:27,980
I appreciate the advice, Kahono.

295
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,380
I'll keep practicing.

296
00:14:30,380 --> 00:14:32,100
Just let me know if you get too tired.

297
00:14:32,620 --> 00:14:35,660
I heal royals such as yourself for the low, low price of a hundred...

298
00:14:35,660 --> 00:14:37,120
I mean, a thousand yule.

299
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,920
What's my fondest memory?

300
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:43,260
That's easy.

301
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:44,340
Sister Lily.

302
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:50,680
I don't know what's more blinding, the sun or your beauty.

303
00:14:50,940 --> 00:14:51,420
Seriously?

304
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,080
You got it!

305
00:14:59,400 --> 00:14:59,820
Yeah!

306
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:00,800
Go, Noelle!

307
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,180
Immortalized in sand.

308
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,280
I miss you, my little goddess.

309
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:09,380
Big sculpture.

310
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,720
Think maybe it's for a contest or something?

311
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:18,340
I'm not done.

312
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:24,140
Thank you, I needed that.

313
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:26,880
Sure, we can settle your tap later.

314
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:27,960
All right.

315
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:30,940
Not yet.

316
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:36,680
No, really.

317
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,320
I couldn't drink another drop.

318
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,760
Not yet!

319
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:45,160
Oh, yeah!

320
00:15:45,160 --> 00:16:07,000
The full moon's tomorrow.

321
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,300
Noelle, this is it.

322
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:10,340
Tonight's my last chance.

323
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:11,820
Hey, Noelle!

324
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:12,780
Don't give up!

325
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:13,920
You can do this!

326
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:18,160
I'm running out of time, and I still have no semblance of control.

327
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,920
At this rate, our mission...

328
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:23,260
I just had a great idea!

329
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:24,480
You did?

330
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:25,140
Listen!

331
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:29,320
Stop thinking about control so much and just let your magic run wild!

332
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,060
Huh?

333
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:31,820
I've been thinking about something!

334
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:36,560
That thing you did the first time your magic went crazy might be exactly what we need!

335
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:40,460
It's like Kahano said before, right?

336
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:42,540
You're trying too hard to hold the mana back.

337
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,600
If you relax and let it do its thing, maybe the spell will actually work!

338
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:47,200
No!

339
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,520
That's just insane!

340
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,940
If it doesn't work, then...

341
00:16:49,940 --> 00:16:50,500
It's fine!

342
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,740
I'll use my sword to keep everyone safe!

343
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:55,100
So quit worrying and go for it!

344
00:16:55,100 --> 00:17:00,360
All right, but if this goes wrong, you better not come crying to me!

345
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:06,860
Okay.

346
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:09,000
I'm letting it go!

347
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:15,960
That's incredible!

348
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:23,740
I knew it!

349
00:17:23,740 --> 00:17:25,620
This isn't working at all!

350
00:17:26,180 --> 00:17:28,900
I'm nowhere close to having a serene mind!

351
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:35,380
Noelle!

352
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:37,620
Come on!

353
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:38,940
What the...

354
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:41,220
I guess it's true.

355
00:17:41,780 --> 00:17:43,240
I really am hopeless.

356
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:44,480
A failure.

357
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:49,460
How am I supposed to focus on a fond memory when I don't have any?

358
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,000
Noelle!

359
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,240
Noelle!

360
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:58,340
What the hell are you doing up there, little Miss Royalty?

361
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:01,040
Is that really the best a Black Bull Knight can do?

362
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:01,640
Huh?

363
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,480
You're wasting all that super strong magic power of yours.

364
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:07,200
The sooner you can control it, the sooner we can spar together.

365
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:12,720
It's not like you'll die if you mess up, so just relax and next time have a little drink to sell your nerves.

366
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:17,380
You've got to be hungry after all that work, so hurry up and finish before I eat everything myself!

367
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:18,720
Don't worry.

368
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:21,160
If you fall, I'll be waiting right here to catch you.

369
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:23,060
Fall and I'll kick you right back up.

370
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,180
So make it work.

371
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,100
Just give it your all!

372
00:18:26,100 --> 00:18:28,640
You can do it!

373
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,940
I know you can, Noelle!

374
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:36,320
Noelle, noelle, we're done!

375
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,340
He's a good job!

376
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,000
I was wrong.

377
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:42,200
I do have fond memories.

378
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:47,620
Hmm, so you're Noelle's little sister, huh?

379
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,440
Your brother was talking about you.

380
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:54,400
Apparently, you're a total failure who can't even control her magic.

381
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,840
You said you'd never pass the entrance exam, even if you tried.

382
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:01,820
You know, I've never seen a royal failure before.

383
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:04,260
Well, if you'll excuse me.

384
00:19:04,260 --> 00:19:07,140
If you really want to fight, you could always join us.

385
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,760
That's right.

386
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:15,160
The worst of the worst Magic Knight squads, the Black Bulls, where all the best failures hang out.

387
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,760
I think you'll fit right in.

388
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:25,620
I spent so many years with my family, and I don't have a single good memory to show for it.

389
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:30,260
I've only been with the Black Bulls for a few months, and yet...

390
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:34,180
I have all these memories.

391
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:37,380
And most of them are good ones.

392
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,200
Very good ones.

393
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,580
The Black Bulls accepted me.

394
00:19:47,140 --> 00:19:48,260
They relied on me.

395
00:19:48,780 --> 00:19:51,880
And now, I want to do something for them!

396
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:58,840
Water creation magic!

397
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:00,560
See Dragon's Kratos!

398
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:09,540
It... it... worked!

399
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,300
We never doubted you, right now!

400
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:13,920
See Dragon's Cradle!

401
00:20:14,340 --> 00:20:15,180
A new spell!

402
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,380
I did it!

403
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:17,960
I really did it!

404
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:23,900
What are you stopping now for?

405
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:24,340
Don't worry!

406
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:25,500
I'll keep the food dry!

407
00:20:27,340 --> 00:20:30,060
Actually, it feels great when your cheeks are all flushed.

408
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:30,560
Phew!

409
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:31,440
Right!

410
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:35,440
That's my cue!

411
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,940
I'm coming to it!

412
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:39,660
That was my job!

413
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:40,460
No fair!

414
00:20:41,140 --> 00:20:43,140
What are you doing, Dorksta?

415
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:45,100
I knew you could pull it off.

416
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:52,040
You spilled the hands off of me!

417
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:54,880
Why are there sheep?

418
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:59,280
Everything turned out perfectly, and I'd say that calls for a drink!

419
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:00,500
Oh, Kahuno!

420
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:01,000
That was awesome!

421
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,500
Did you see?

422
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:02,840
Huh?

423
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,880
Where'd she go?

424
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:05,640
All right!

425
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,720
It's party time!

426
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:07,320
Oh, yeah!

427
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:08,420
Let's light it up!

428
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:09,340
Yeah!

429
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:17,880
I told you to push past your limits, and that's exactly what you did.

430
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:20,680
I guess we better get going soon.

431
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,540
The temple's waiting for us.

432
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:27,080
You've got great friends.

433
00:21:27,540 --> 00:21:30,040
In the end, they're the ones who should be here cheering you on.

434
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:31,520
I'm glad it all worked out.

435
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:34,100
Can't wait till the next time we meet, Noelle.

436
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:35,520
I'll see you in the temple!

437
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:36,580
Bye!

438
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,880
Bye!

439
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,880
Bye!

440
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,700
Bye!

441
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:53,640
Bye!

442
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:08,200
Bye!

443
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:09,680
moi

444
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:16,540
my

445
00:23:16,540 --> 00:23:20,540
Song recovery magic? That's amazing! Will you sing for me, please?

446
00:23:20,540 --> 00:23:23,540
I'd be happy to! For 10 billion Yule!

447
00:23:23,540 --> 00:23:24,540
Here!

448
00:23:24,540 --> 00:23:25,540
Alright, let's go!

449
00:23:28,540 --> 00:23:30,540
L-O-B-E!

450
00:23:30,540 --> 00:23:32,540
What is it doing?

451
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:41,540
I meet some new friends! Once Noelle can control her magic, she'll be unstoppable!

452
00:23:41,540 --> 00:23:43,540
I can't wait to see her again!

453
00:23:43,540 --> 00:23:48,540
Black Clover, page 42, The Underwater Temple. My magic is song magic!

